      "updated": 1731629039585,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "It's now time to learn about template engine and one of \nthe most popular template engine is EJS which stand's\nfor embeded javascript which basically embed the js \ninto the html tags\n\nNow the real question is what is the use of template engine \nand why do we need it when we can use Normal html and vanila js \n\n\nlet's try to understand it with a example :\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "It's now time to learn about template engine and one of \nthe most popular template engine is EJS which stand's\nfor embeded javascript which basically embed the js \ninto the html tags\n\nNow the real question is what is the use of template engine \nand why do we need it when we can use Normal html and vanila js \n\n\nlet's try to understand it with a example :\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
