      "versionNonce": 1778934661,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1731672651099,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "So let's  convert the above html code into ejs so  that we can render the processed data from server via post \nmethod handler ",
