      "originalText": "Now here first we have checked using \nif condition that is if \nlocal variable result is \nvalid or not that is does \nit have a define value or it \nundefined or null and the reason \nto check is that when we render the \npage in GET:/ route in render \nmethod we dont pass variable and \nit value so the local variable value will become \nundefined",
